WEBVTT

00:02.400 --> 00:07.510
Why from a falling pit?!

00:18.680 --> 00:19.460
Look.

00:22.880 --> 00:25.050
Oh? This place...

00:25.050 --> 00:27.240
The arena for the last boss!

00:34.890 --> 00:37.680
I SLEEP HERE
"I sleep here."

00:37.680 --> 00:39.020
I SLEEP HERE

00:39.600 --> 00:41.980
"I sleep here."

00:41.980 --> 00:42.520
I am tired of this game

00:42.520 --> 00:44.650
PLAYER.13: GOOD GAME WELL PLAYED
I am tired of this game

00:44.650 --> 00:46.550
PLAYER.13: GOOD GAME WELL PLAYED
since no one has come to conquer it.

00:46.550 --> 00:48.160
PLAYER.13: GOOD GAME WELL PLAYED
Goodbye.

00:48.160 --> 00:49.450
PLAYER.13: GOOD GAME WELL PLAYED

00:49.450 --> 00:53.270
Even though I anticipated it,
I didn't expect it to be like this.

00:54.030 --> 00:56.550
So as long as the last boss is dead,

00:56.550 --> 00:58.260
this game cannot be cleared.

00:58.260 --> 01:01.410
If it's impossible to conquer the game
without the last boss,

01:01.410 --> 01:03.550
we just need to resurrect
the god and defeat him.

01:03.550 --> 01:04.170
Huh?

01:04.490 --> 01:06.690
What's with that ridiculous theory?!

01:06.690 --> 01:08.880
Oh, I think we can do it.

01:08.880 --> 01:12.250
Because this is the labyrinth
of death and rebirth.

01:12.250 --> 01:14.850
It's a labyrinth of death,
followed by rebirth.

01:14.850 --> 01:15.670
That's right.

01:15.670 --> 01:19.060
In this game, the concept of rebirth
is always in place,

01:19.420 --> 01:24.150
and we, players and monsters, have all
been fairly resurrected by respawning.

01:25.940 --> 01:29.060
Then, even god should be resurrected.

01:31.270 --> 01:32.610
That's...

01:35.270 --> 01:37.040
The Bell of Resurrection!

01:43.580 --> 01:46.920
Now is the time to be resurrected, last boss.

01:55.620 --> 01:57.600
Nothing happens.

01:58.640 --> 02:02.950
"I am tired of this game
since no one has come to conquer it."

02:02.950 --> 02:06.310
In other words, the god wants us
to clear this game first.

02:07.210 --> 02:08.450
The release value!

02:08.780 --> 02:13.740
Yes. The release value is the score
for releasing god from the grave.

02:13.740 --> 02:14.820
I see!

02:15.910 --> 02:18.220
By clearing all areas of this labyrinth,

02:18.220 --> 02:21.330
conquering all gimmicks,
defeating all bosses,

02:21.330 --> 02:24.420
and acquiring all items,
the value will be 100%,

02:24.810 --> 02:26.750
and then the god will be resurrected.

02:26.750 --> 02:28.290
That's so absurd!

02:28.290 --> 02:30.760
It will take thousands of hours!

02:30.760 --> 02:33.300
Yeah, that's why "we all" must do it.

02:33.720 --> 02:36.680
There are 200 apostles
who have been wandering

02:36.680 --> 02:38.250
this labyrinth for hundreds of hours.

02:38.660 --> 02:40.320
We'll meet up with the first group,

02:40.320 --> 02:42.600
including us and 50 apostles
from the rescue team,

02:42.950 --> 02:46.310
and we'll share information with them.

02:53.400 --> 02:54.320
What?!

02:54.800 --> 02:56.780
These are rare items, aren't they?!

02:57.250 --> 02:59.850
How much time did you
spend collecting them?

03:00.410 --> 03:02.270
I'm glad you're back.

03:02.270 --> 03:03.190
Sure.

03:09.330 --> 03:10.630
Wow!

03:10.630 --> 03:12.900
Is this the map to conquer this game?

03:15.890 --> 03:19.340
Once you get a rare item, bring it here.

03:19.340 --> 03:20.170
Okay.

03:21.380 --> 03:23.810
With this Treasure Room's Master Key,

03:23.810 --> 03:26.110
you can bring as many items as you want.

03:26.510 --> 03:28.070
That's cool!

03:28.070 --> 03:29.770
Fay!

03:29.770 --> 03:31.980
It is a great discovery!

03:31.980 --> 03:33.880
Please look at this!

03:34.940 --> 03:37.410
Huh? That's...

03:37.990 --> 03:42.170
Just like us, we washed
the Zombie Puffs in a waterfall.

03:51.380 --> 03:55.190
And they returned
to the cute Puff like this!

03:57.900 --> 03:59.410
That's not all.

03:59.410 --> 04:01.760
By bringing back all the Zombie Puffs,

04:02.440 --> 04:05.720
they thanked us and guided us
to the Puff Village.

04:11.720 --> 04:13.520
And we got this.

04:13.520 --> 04:14.800
This item allows us to explore

04:14.800 --> 04:17.990
PUFF'S CREST - YOU CAN GET ALONG WITH PUFFS
without being seen as an enemy by all the Puffs.

04:19.840 --> 04:22.320
And that's it. Please help us.

04:22.320 --> 04:23.280
Yeah!

04:28.000 --> 04:29.870
RUIN BRANCH AFFILIATION - BLAZE
CAPTAIN: ASHLAN

04:30.460 --> 04:32.340
MAL-RA BRANCH AFFILIATION - ARCHANGEL
CAPTAIN: CAMILLA

04:32.920 --> 04:34.800
FISCHERLA BRANCH AFFILIATION - MYSTICAL TUTOR
CAPTAIN: EZRAYS

04:35.380 --> 04:36.770
CASSIN BRANCH AFFILIATION - LEGACY
CAPTAIN: LANIOS

04:36.770 --> 04:38.010
POL-A BRANCH AFFILIATION - SETSUGEKKA
CAPTAIN: NAYUTA

04:38.790 --> 04:41.720
Area bosses are tough to conquer,

04:41.720 --> 04:45.930
but I feel that if we keep respawning
and trying, we can conquer them.

04:45.930 --> 04:49.950
I think the biggest challenge
to making this value 100%

04:49.950 --> 04:53.290
is finding all the hidden events.

04:55.610 --> 04:56.860
Here comes another one!

04:56.860 --> 04:57.570
NEW AREA BOSS - KING ERASER
Here comes another one!

04:57.570 --> 04:59.070
NEW AREA BOSS - KING ERASER

04:59.070 --> 05:02.170
What a strong monster
for such a ridiculous name!

05:02.170 --> 05:03.960
If we touch it, we die instantly.

05:03.960 --> 05:06.120
How are we going to beat it?

05:06.120 --> 05:08.750
NEW AREA - KILLER APPLE'S FOREST

05:13.870 --> 05:17.740
Everyone is doing their best.
I'm sure we'll find it.

05:17.740 --> 05:18.990
You're right.

05:33.690 --> 05:35.420
A hidden door?

05:40.780 --> 05:43.040
It's all junk, isn't it?

05:45.370 --> 05:46.740
This is...

05:51.600 --> 05:53.680
Look at this ruby.

05:54.130 --> 05:57.370
Wow, so a ruby can shine
that brightly too.

05:57.370 --> 05:58.710
Wait!

05:58.710 --> 06:01.170
My eyes are more beautiful!

06:01.170 --> 06:03.210
The one that I gave you!

06:03.550 --> 06:07.390
This tiny ruby is nothing
compared to my eyes...

06:07.390 --> 06:08.980
I've been waiting for you!

06:15.660 --> 06:18.230
I am the Guardian Sphinx!

06:18.230 --> 06:19.990
W-What?!

06:19.990 --> 06:21.940
Is this the raid boss?!

06:22.370 --> 06:24.570
The ones you've faced so far

06:24.570 --> 06:27.460
are only the weakest of the raid bosses!

06:27.870 --> 06:29.690
But I am different!

06:30.740 --> 06:34.090
Behold, my true form!

06:42.920 --> 06:45.380
Once I go into battle mode,

06:45.930 --> 06:47.850
all kinds of Arises will be ineffective!

06:48.430 --> 06:53.290
I will crush you all in a heartbeat!

06:54.960 --> 06:56.020
Shut up.

07:01.400 --> 07:04.570
SPHINX RECEIVED 96.198.308.799.000.199 DAMAGE
SPHINX DEFEATED

07:04.570 --> 07:08.320
Geez. I'm still talking,
you small puppy.

07:08.740 --> 07:10.530
Uh-oh... I'm screwed...

07:12.970 --> 07:16.830
You've done it again!
You're out!

07:18.670 --> 07:20.040
It is what it is.

07:20.410 --> 07:22.800
I'll go back to the human world first,

07:22.800 --> 07:25.250
so you must clear this game
and come back.

07:29.010 --> 07:31.070
She's out...

07:33.180 --> 07:36.300
Well, if she wants us to come back
after clearing this game,

07:36.300 --> 07:39.650
it means "don't come back
until you clear the game."

07:40.290 --> 07:42.560
We must answer her expectations.

07:42.980 --> 07:45.990
GODS' GAMES WE PLAY

07:51.910 --> 07:54.080
I'm tired...

07:54.080 --> 07:56.250
I can't move anymore...

07:56.780 --> 07:59.630
I've run out of energy...

08:04.320 --> 08:06.300
Fay!

08:06.900 --> 08:08.680
We found it!

08:08.680 --> 08:11.510
We've found the last gimmick!

08:19.340 --> 08:23.190
It is a strange place where
dice are enshrined, but...

08:23.840 --> 08:27.500
"Make everything into one."
That's what it said.

08:27.500 --> 08:31.370
Does that mean that all of these
dice's eyes must be one?

08:36.160 --> 08:40.770
The probability of 24 faces is too high...

08:40.770 --> 08:43.380
It's about 200 million tries
to get the same number.

08:43.730 --> 08:45.920
I finally found you, Fay!

08:47.630 --> 08:49.090
Dax!

08:49.090 --> 08:53.590
It seems we're destined
to meet again after all!

09:03.810 --> 09:05.650
What are you doing?

09:05.650 --> 09:07.650
I don't like this dirt.

09:07.650 --> 09:11.610
If I'm going to roll dice,
they should be shiny.

09:11.610 --> 09:14.370
You mean you're going to roll it?

09:14.370 --> 09:17.660
It's done! Behold this brilliance!

09:21.460 --> 09:24.670
The time has come!
Gather, messengers of destiny!

09:25.100 --> 09:29.010
A new era is dawning,
and a glorious door is opening!

09:29.630 --> 09:32.010
I call it Dax Dice!

09:37.730 --> 09:39.180
No way!

09:40.330 --> 09:42.300
This is who he is.

09:52.450 --> 09:55.740
ITEM: MIRROR OF DAWN
OVERTURN THE TOTAL WIPED OUT ONLY ONCE

09:59.090 --> 10:01.460
With this, we've cleared all the events!

10:04.630 --> 10:06.340
You're going back already?

10:07.470 --> 10:11.670
We are lifelong rivals guided by fate.

10:12.190 --> 10:15.300
But I'll leave the rest of the game
to you from here!

10:16.530 --> 10:20.390
"There is a possibility that there are people
who can't return that we haven't found,

10:20.390 --> 10:22.320
finding them is our priority."

10:22.320 --> 10:23.640
That's what he said.

10:27.110 --> 10:28.440
Thanks for the help.

10:28.440 --> 10:30.190
Thank you, Dax.

10:33.780 --> 10:36.150
Well, see you again.

10:39.450 --> 10:40.470
What?!

10:41.120 --> 10:44.330
I-It can't be... Why?

10:47.010 --> 10:50.130
0.001% point left?!

10:50.130 --> 10:53.190
We've already explored the labyrinth.

10:53.190 --> 10:55.810
I thought this would be the last quest...

10:56.980 --> 10:57.970
That's it!

10:58.460 --> 11:01.180
There's nothing left in the labyrinth!

11:02.220 --> 11:04.750
When did the release value appear?

11:05.150 --> 11:06.710
Since we entered the labyrinth?

11:07.650 --> 11:08.560
No, it wasn't!

11:09.230 --> 11:12.030
Huh? What are these numbers?

11:13.030 --> 11:15.700
If our release value is 100
only in the labyrinth,

11:16.070 --> 11:18.410
it should be displayed after
we enter the labyrinth.

11:18.800 --> 11:21.370
If it appeared before that...

11:25.970 --> 11:28.920
That's right!
There's a big hole here!

11:29.270 --> 11:31.520
This is the final! Let's go!

11:39.220 --> 11:40.660
We did it!

11:47.710 --> 11:49.040
I see...

11:54.370 --> 11:55.950
That big hole

11:55.950 --> 12:00.660
was the shortest route to the deepest part
of the labyrinth from the beginning.

12:01.260 --> 12:04.730
Come on, god,
the conditions have been met!

12:04.730 --> 12:06.330
It's time for you to respawn!

12:09.040 --> 12:11.150
It's time to compare the answers.

12:11.150 --> 12:14.260
There are the challengers
you've been waiting for.

12:14.260 --> 12:15.260
Come out now!

12:30.620 --> 12:33.660
I am Anubis, the God of the Underworld.

12:33.660 --> 12:37.770
I am the creator
and the last boss of this game!

12:38.150 --> 12:39.530
ELEMENTS
RUSHEIMARE OF DEATH AND REBIRTH LABYRINTH

12:39.530 --> 12:42.370
VS UNDERWORLD GOD, ANUBIS

12:42.370 --> 12:42.990
WIN CONDITION:

12:42.990 --> 12:43.840
DEFEAT OF THE GOD OF THE UNDERWORLD.
HOWEVER, THE CONDITION OF DEFEAT IS UNKNOWN

12:43.840 --> 12:44.340
LOSE CONDITION:

12:44.340 --> 12:45.080
ALL PLAYERS' SIDES ARE RESPAWNED

12:45.080 --> 12:46.090
ADDITIONAL RULES:

12:46.090 --> 12:48.290
ALL ITEMS ACQUIRED IN THE LABYRINTH
OF RUSHEIMARE CAN BE USED

12:48.290 --> 12:51.250
Now, let's play, humans!

12:56.180 --> 12:58.280
We're counting on you, Fay!

12:59.550 --> 13:02.800
Come, all my lovely pets!

13:02.800 --> 13:04.940
Hundred Beasts Summon!

13:19.650 --> 13:21.170
Wait a minute!

13:21.170 --> 13:23.490
It's not fair to summon them all at once!

13:24.710 --> 13:27.450
These are the enhanced versions I've raised.

13:27.450 --> 13:28.830
First, Sleeping Lion!

13:29.230 --> 13:32.820
Let's see your special move!

13:36.170 --> 13:38.380
Equip that thing, everyone!

13:51.190 --> 13:52.560
THE SLEEPING LION'S EXTRA RAGE ARTS

13:52.560 --> 13:55.150
THE RAGE DESCENDS FROM
THE HEAVENS DESTROYS ALL

13:55.150 --> 13:58.610
EVERYTHING AROUND THE LION HAS PERISHED

14:11.690 --> 14:14.170
Huh? They're gone...

14:16.430 --> 14:21.130
You fool! How dare you destroy
your fellow monsters!

14:22.590 --> 14:23.940
I see!

14:24.590 --> 14:26.550
So that's how it is!

14:27.550 --> 14:29.260
Her weakness...

14:29.260 --> 14:30.420
...is her brain!

14:31.440 --> 14:34.350
What do you mean by my brain?!

14:34.790 --> 14:36.610
It's yours!

14:36.610 --> 14:39.750
The Ultimate Battle Weapon,
the Megalithic Rocket!

14:39.750 --> 14:42.240
It can blow to any boss!

15:01.450 --> 15:03.090
How naive, little girl!

15:03.090 --> 15:07.180
Did you think you could finish me off
with such a puny attack?

15:07.180 --> 15:10.510
You're the one who called it
the "Ultimate Battle Weapon"!

15:10.510 --> 15:11.540
I forgot.

15:11.540 --> 15:13.200
What do you mean you forgot?!

15:13.200 --> 15:16.390
I summon a hundred Golden Puffs!

15:21.730 --> 15:24.320
The numbers are wrong...

15:24.320 --> 15:27.950
And then there's the "God Eraser"!

15:29.240 --> 15:32.400
In 70 seconds, you will be annihilated.

15:32.400 --> 15:36.630
Umm... I am the founder of Underworld Dawn...

15:36.630 --> 15:38.290
And... Err...

15:38.290 --> 15:40.750
It is impossible to defeat
a hundred Golden Puffs

15:40.750 --> 15:44.160
and stop that technique!

15:44.160 --> 15:45.280
Is that so?

15:45.280 --> 15:46.220
Huh?

15:46.220 --> 15:48.430
With this Puff's Crest,

15:48.430 --> 15:51.390
we can avoid fighting all Puffs.

16:02.090 --> 16:03.860
Alright! Counterattack!

16:03.860 --> 16:05.860
- I am the one who performs...
- She can't move now!

16:05.860 --> 16:06.610
Eh?

16:08.070 --> 16:09.570
Let's focus on her!

16:09.570 --> 16:11.590
I guess I don't need to chant that!

16:11.590 --> 16:14.650
God Eraser shall be able to fire
without chanting!

16:14.650 --> 16:15.500
What?

16:15.500 --> 16:18.800
God Eraser!

16:19.310 --> 16:20.640
Fire!

16:26.590 --> 16:29.510
ALL PLAYERS PERISHED

16:32.050 --> 16:36.140
MIRROR OF DAWN'S EFFECT:
CAN RESURRECT ONLY ONCE

16:39.760 --> 16:43.590
Wait a second!
How can you change the rule like that?!

16:43.590 --> 16:45.570
That's why I'm the last boss.

16:45.570 --> 16:48.060
I will show you my great magic.

16:48.060 --> 16:51.110
Instant death to all those on the ground!

16:53.310 --> 16:54.280
Everyone, jump!

16:55.490 --> 16:57.440
Oh? Good.

16:57.440 --> 17:01.920
Second great magic!
Instant damage to all in the air!

17:03.390 --> 17:04.590
Bend down!

17:07.050 --> 17:11.010
This is so fun!
I still love this game!

17:12.620 --> 17:13.930
That's not fair!

17:13.930 --> 17:18.180
If you looked that happy in this shitty game,
it makes me want to play with you!

17:18.180 --> 17:21.520
And now, I'll use God Eraser once again!

17:22.220 --> 17:24.860
Chanting time is zero, of course!

17:25.870 --> 17:27.190
Then, we'll use this item...

17:27.190 --> 17:28.820
Item seal!

17:30.900 --> 17:34.280
ADDITIONAL RULE: ITEM SEAL
USING ITEMS IS PROHIBITED BY THE GAME MASTER

17:37.130 --> 17:39.280
Here I go!

17:39.280 --> 17:42.670
God Eraser!

17:43.500 --> 17:46.170
Moment Reversal!

17:57.630 --> 17:58.470
Nel!

18:05.660 --> 18:07.390
Not bad.

18:07.390 --> 18:10.610
Next, it'll be the biggest attack.

18:10.610 --> 18:13.710
It will blow up the entire arena!

18:15.320 --> 18:17.780
The arena...
I see!

18:20.370 --> 18:23.670
That's a clue!
We're getting out of here!

18:23.670 --> 18:26.130
I'm sorry, Master Fay.

18:26.130 --> 18:27.430
Thank you.

18:27.430 --> 18:29.000
We'll handle the rest.

18:31.300 --> 18:32.470
Let's go!

18:32.470 --> 18:33.800
I won't let you!

18:36.720 --> 18:37.870
We won't let you pass!

18:39.570 --> 18:40.770
The exit...

18:41.180 --> 18:42.770
Leave it to me!

18:45.230 --> 18:47.830
Blow up!

18:51.910 --> 18:53.650
Get out of the way!

18:54.350 --> 18:56.100
The Wandering!

18:58.080 --> 19:03.370
God Eraser!

19:08.290 --> 19:09.980
Let's jump!

19:37.860 --> 19:40.950
Ah! Where's the god?

20:06.580 --> 20:08.230
I am really satisfied.

20:17.330 --> 20:18.630
That was fun.

20:19.070 --> 20:21.990
You did a great job
playing through all my games.

20:22.350 --> 20:25.780
All the items, all the areas,
all the events—

20:25.780 --> 20:28.210
it must have been a tremendous journey.

20:28.710 --> 20:32.920
I could feel your passion for my game.

20:33.450 --> 20:37.110
After all, I wanted to make sure of that.

20:37.530 --> 20:38.470
That's why...

20:39.170 --> 20:41.090
It's your win.

20:45.810 --> 20:48.380
- Yeah!
- We did it!

20:49.270 --> 20:51.460
It was a hell of a game.

20:52.610 --> 20:54.010
I'll give you a reward.

20:55.550 --> 20:58.570
It would be tasteless if I were
the only one who enjoyed it, right?

20:58.570 --> 21:01.590
I'll give that key to you.

21:05.760 --> 21:07.640
I'm satisfied.

21:08.110 --> 21:11.670
I want to play again,
so revive me next time.

21:15.650 --> 21:16.690
What?

21:17.470 --> 21:22.810
Then, don't die!

21:32.770 --> 21:34.270
VS ANUBIS, THE TWO-PHASE DEATH AND REBIRTH

21:34.270 --> 21:35.760
LABYRINTH ESCAPE GAME
TIME ELAPSED: UNKNOWN

21:35.760 --> 21:37.230
OFFICIAL TIME IS BEING MEASURED
AT THE ARCANE COURT - WIN

21:37.230 --> 21:38.260
WIN CONDITION:

21:38.260 --> 21:39.380
DEFEAT THE LAST BOSS
IN THE DEEPEST PART OF THE LABYRINTH

21:39.380 --> 21:40.460
LOSE CONDITION:

21:40.460 --> 21:41.530
NONE

21:41.530 --> 21:42.330
ROPPED ITEM

21:42.330 --> 21:43.310
THE TRUE TREASURE ROOM'S MASTER KEY

21:43.310 --> 21:44.620
DROPPED ON: MYTHICAL DIFFICULTY

21:44.620 --> 21:45.700
YOU CAN SUMMON ANY ITEMS FROM
THE LABYRINTH OF RUSHEIMARE

21:49.410 --> 21:50.810
We're back.

21:56.820 --> 21:58.380
Welcome back, everyone!

21:58.380 --> 21:59.380
Good game!

21:59.730 --> 22:01.730
The labyrinth game with no return

22:01.730 --> 22:04.090
was an unprecedented event,

22:04.470 --> 22:07.290
but you guys cleared it up
and made it out.

22:07.290 --> 22:09.060
You really did well!

22:10.110 --> 22:11.650
I'm at my limit...

22:11.650 --> 22:13.770
It was a tremendous game.

22:14.310 --> 22:16.500
Finally, I can rest this time...

22:17.630 --> 22:19.230
What are you talking about?

22:19.230 --> 22:21.750
We're going to the next game, remember?

22:21.750 --> 22:22.940
What?!

22:22.940 --> 22:24.320
That's right!

22:24.320 --> 22:27.530
Humans, let's play my game!

22:27.530 --> 22:28.810
Eh?

22:28.810 --> 22:30.000
Fay,

22:30.000 --> 22:31.850
let's go to the next game!

22:31.850 --> 22:33.710
My game first!

22:33.710 --> 22:35.630
We've already played that before!

22:35.630 --> 22:37.530
We'll play your game later!

22:42.530 --> 22:44.860
Then, let's play it all.

22:45.290 --> 22:46.890
That's right!

22:47.380 --> 22:49.600
We can play to our hearts'
content again, right?

23:00.620 --> 23:01.780
Yeah!

23:03.570 --> 23:07.620
Can I count on you guys
to conquer the gods' games?

23:07.620 --> 23:11.020
I'm just going to have fun, as usual.

23:12.530 --> 23:14.080
With this team.

23:14.640 --> 23:16.510
Geez, it can't be helped.

23:16.510 --> 23:18.500
If that's the way Master Fay wants it!

23:29.190 --> 23:31.100
I'm really excited.

23:31.100 --> 23:32.200
Yeah.

23:32.650 --> 23:33.900
This is the beginning...

23:35.410 --> 23:38.030
...of our new games!
